<title>POLAND: PPWK REVISES DOWN H1 NET PROFIT.</title>
<headline>PPWK REVISES DOWN H1 NET PROFIT.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-08-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>PPWK SA preliminary results for</p>
<p>period ending June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>					    H1 1996	H1 1995</p>
<p>    operating				3.28   vs    2.43</p>
<p>    pre-tax				  3.01   vs    2.11</p>
<p>    net					1.90   vs    1.28</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Polskie Przedsiebiorstwo</p>
<p>Wydawnictw Kartograficznych SA. Earlier the company reported</p>
<p>its net profit at PLN 2.1 million zlotys.</p>
<p>    net sales			     11.31   vs    8.53</p>
<p>    costs of sales			 5.67   vs    4.36</p>
<p>    income tax			     1.11   vs    0.83</p>
<p>    financial revenues		   0.02   vs    0.03</p>
<p>    financial costs			0.29   vs    0.35</p>
<p>    investment			     0.10   vs    0.56</p>
<p>    depreciation			   0.16   vs    0.18</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
